  "solution": "Vì quãng đường đi là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>x</mi></semantics></math> (km), <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên số tiền là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>y</mi></semantics></math> được biểu diễn\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10500</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>14500</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>25</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>12500</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12500</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>53250</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tDo đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12500</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>53250</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>12500</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>53250</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>6575</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
